00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:00.200
"What should I call it... something like a final, decisive blow. Momo-chan's enclosure at Reasal is about this length."

unit-0026
00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:00.200
"It's the kind of thing that makes you think, 'This is it,' or 'This is the end.' It's the kind of feeling that Mai-chan's performance gave me."

unit-0027
00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:00.200
"It was perfect. Wow, such an aggressive approach."

unit-0028
00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:05.560
"It's certainly quite difficult right now, and this situation is really challenging. But don't worry, you can handle it. We're making adjustments and seeing a significant response."

unit-0029
00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:55.720
<v SPEAKER_01>"It's also effective in close-quarters combat, and it's revealing Amayumika's techniques. By the way, Gouki has more HP than other characters."

