unit-0033
00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:19.000
<v SPEAKER_03>"I'm pretty sure it was 10,000. And with that many options, it's huge, right? Even though it's ranked, it still feels powerful. It has a lot of combo potential with its Aiki."

unit-0034
00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:25.880
<v SPEAKER_03>"It feels amazing when you land it. It hits really well, dealing a lot of damage. Yeah, it really shreds the opponent. Now that it's reached this level..."

unit-0035
00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:35.640
<v SPEAKER_03>"When it happens, it's probably not something that can be done easily. Hmm, who speaks during Tachiwawa's timeouts? Who does Tachiwawa speak to?"

unit-0036
00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:45.080
<v SPEAKER_00>“It's about speaking, but it might not be necessary. You need to think for yourself; you need to think it through. Just observe the changing expressions.”

unit-0037
00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:45.960
<v SPEAKER_00>"Let's proceed with a measured approach."

unit-0038
00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:08.740
"It's not quite working out yet. I'm still trying to break free from this feeling. There's still more to explore, I think. And Tachikawa-san... her style is so modern, but it feels completely different from my own."

unit-0039
00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:08.740
"It feels like I'm stuck in the same place. It doesn't feel truly modern, does it? I think I've finally grasped this feeling. It seems simple, but... and then, there's..."

unit-0040
00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:08.740
"There are so many things, aren't there? Yes, yes, yes. It makes you think... but the background music isn't really noticeable, is it?"

unit-0041
00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:12.000
That's so powerful. It really is. It's like this. They're so skilled. True professionals, definitely. Amazing, they're so good.

unit-0042
00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:12.000
Definitely the SA gauge.

unit-0043
00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:45.840
<v SPEAKER_02>It's just incredible – a modern character with that kind of presence, fighting against professionals, especially considering they're in that upper echelon.

unit-0044
00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:53.706
<v SPEAKER_03>It feels like they're just standing there, arms crossed, watching – it's like watching someone from behind an arcade game.

unit-0045
00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.760
<v SPEAKER_01>“That’s not a bad composition, that's nice. I'm thinking, I'd like to watch from behind too.”

unit-0046
00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.800
<v SPEAKER_01>“The live performance is great. During the intense parts, the camera work is really impressive.”

unit-0047
00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:10.020
"I'm concerned that they're showing signs of burnout, despite our efforts to support them."

unit-0048
00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:13.620
Okay, okay, I understand. But two perfect [items/characters], 22 and 22… there's no "V" [likely referring to a specific item or character], and there's no partner. I can't use this [item/character/combination].

unit-0049
00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:13.620
No, I can't use this. There's no partner. There's no partner available. This is the first match against the opposing team. Okay, and I've got about 100 [points/items/resources] now.

unit-0050
00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:13.620
Various things are appearing at the top, and they're also coming to the edges of the screen. It's appearing. Then, it rises, and after that, I went in front of the shadow.

unit-0051
00:09:13.620 --> 00:10:10.900
<v SPEAKER_01>The drive was a really good one. They used it effectively to recover, and they turned the situation around. Ah, and then they were attacked.

unit-0052
00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:12.880
They were in a difficult situation, but if they could make a substitution, the white player would probably do something. There are a lot of possibilities, and they need to act quickly. It's going to be intense.

unit-0053
00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:12.880
If it fails, it's fine. It's a crucial point, so we have to fight hard. It's incredible. We can't hesitate; we have to move forward. I'll do my best.

unit-0054
00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:46.480
<v SPEAKER_01>That's a real opportunity to secure a win. It's important to act quickly. We need to seize this moment. It feels significant.

unit-0055
00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:49.680
<v SPEAKER_02>Jilly said "Ahhhh."

unit-0056
00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:59.440
<v SPEAKER_01>This full round is incredible. I'm so excited; I've been waiting for this. I'm going to show them what I can do. I'm establishing my position.

unit-0057
00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:00.240
<v SPEAKER_01>I'm going to show them, and that's a good thing.

unit-0058
00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:25.580
<v SPEAKER_01>Press the button. Go behind Tachikawa. Tachikawa's drive is fleeting.

unit-0059
00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:31.740
<v SPEAKER_01>That's quite something. I managed to avoid the drive. Even from here, this is something.

unit-0060
00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:40.060
<v SPEAKER_02>They're trying to turn the gauge into a charm. There were malfunctions. This is it, isn't it? This is it, really. They're making it happen. They're making it happen. Boo.

unit-0061
00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:42.060
<v SPEAKER_00>Wow, I'm so moved! I'm going to cry.

unit-0062
00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:22.080
Well, that's it! That makes a perfect, undefeated record for VS Carlease. Congratulations, that's amazing! Congratulations, everyone, you won!

unit-0063
00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:22.080
Right? This is what it means to be a real professional. Seriously, you can become a pro! Moka, you can do it! Moka, you can achieve great things. Go out there and soar, Moka! That's amazing!

unit-0064
00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:22.080
It's truly amazing; I'm so moved. I wonder if the next team will be okay. It's really touching. There's also that player – he's incredible. I'm genuinely moved.

unit-0065
00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:22.080
It was truly inspiring, and I'm grateful for my coach.

unit-0066
00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:08.880
<v SPEAKER_00>I thought it might have been related to a "trusted viewing" feature. It was the first time I'm ever seen someone cry while watching someone else play a game, but it was truly amazing.

unit-0067
00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:15.760
<v SPEAKER_02>I'm going to keep going until I beat this incredible opponent.

unit-0068
00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:18.000
<v SPEAKER_02>Considering all the effort it took, it's truly amazing.

unit-0069
00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:28.860
<v SPEAKER_01>"I can't afford to lose. It's been quite the effort, and we're bringing you this live from the commentary booth. Mr. Hiraiwa, please, let's start with an introduction."

