<v SPEAKER_02>"Let me be the one responding."

unit-0073
00:13:52.700 --> 00:14:01.420
<v SPEAKER_02>"I thought you might be participating in some smaller leagues, perhaps. Maybe you're really that good. And, well, you're doing quite well so far."

unit-0074
00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:09.180
<v SPEAKER_02>"It was tough dealing with Bon, always appearing and disappearing. Ah, and Takeda, too. Seriously, I think he was definitely teaching Bon."

