00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:10.540
<v SPEAKER_02>"There are 34 of them."

unit-0076
00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:18.300
<v SPEAKER_02>"I really felt affected by how they kept appearing and disappearing. It definitely highlighted the coach's skill, I think. Yeah, just a little bit."

unit-0077
00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:23.660
<v SPEAKER_04>"Mr. Tachikawa says that, but Ms. Moka, was there really something like that? A moment where the coach's strategy was clearly evident?"

