unit-0080
00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.880
<v SPEAKER_03>“I’ll do my best to be like that. Yes.”

unit-0081
00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.640
<v SPEAKER_02>“And, well, it's like this, you see…”

unit-0082
00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:44.000
<v SPEAKER_02>“It's happening here next year for the Capcom Cup. They're asking people to participate during the competitive season. See you later.”

