00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:45.600
<v SPEAKER_02>“Well, regarding that…”

unit-0084
00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:49.440
<v SPEAKER_02>“I'm steadily learning from Tenju-san, receiving guidance from the very beginning on various things.”

unit-0085
00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:57.700
<v SPEAKER_04>“I would like to continue to work hard and I appreciate everyone's continued support. Thank you, Tajika-san.”

unit-0086
00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:01.920
<v SPEAKER_04>“Nemoca-san achieved a wonderful victory. Coach Bon, how was it for you?”

unit-0087
00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:05.360
<v SPEAKER_05>“Wow, the excitement really built up! Thank you for your support.”

unit-0088
00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:12.880
<v SPEAKER_00>“It was incredible. And, well, it's great that we were able to perform as we practiced.”

unit-0089
00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:17.360
<v SPEAKER_05>“Regarding our performance, it's really rewarding when we see those improvements reflected in our victories.”

unit-0090
00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:23.040
<v SPEAKER_05>“It's truly the best feeling to see the results of all the hard work we both put in during practice.”

unit-0091
00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:30.940
<v SPEAKER_05>“It really felt like they were determined to win, and even though it might not have been ideal for me, I’m happy that Moka-san was able to secure the victory this time.”

unit-0092
00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:37.420
<v SPEAKER_05>“I think there will be other opportunities to participate in various events, so I hope we can have another good match then. Looking forward to the rest of it.”

unit-0093
00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:41.420
<v SPEAKER_04>“Please do your best. Thank you. We still have the next match, so…”

